<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gymboree cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gymboree cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer downgraded Gymboree Corp to market perform from buy, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Gymboree closed Wednesday at 22-5/8.</p>
</text>
